1
00:00:00,969 --> 00:00:05,179
(Sheldon:)You're right. I'm smart as a whip.
l should be able to figure this out.

2
00:00:09,102 --> 00:00:11,812
(Leonard:)Listen, I kind of made plans
with the guys this weekend.

3
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:14,820
l wondered, because
we're in this relationship beta test...

4
00:00:14,983 --> 00:00:16,813
(Leonard:)...if I should have asked you first.

5
00:00:16,985 --> 00:00:19,615
(Leonard:)Then I thought if
l did check with you first...

6
00:00:19,779 --> 00:00:22,699
(Leonard:)...you'd think that
l was taking things too seriously...

7
00:00:22,907 --> 00:00:25,037
...and then I got a nosebleed.

8
00:00:27,329 --> 00:00:29,749
(Penny:)You don't have to check with me.
Do whatever you want.

9
00:00:29,914 --> 00:00:31,454
(Leonard:)Oh.

10
00:00:31,624 --> 00:00:34,334
(Leonard:)Guess I was hoping
for a different reaction, but okay.

11
00:00:34,711 --> 00:00:37,501
- Really? What were you hoping for?
- l don't know.

12
00:00:37,672 --> 00:00:39,552
(Leonard:)Maybe that you'd be a little upset.

13
00:00:39,716 --> 00:00:43,846
(Leonard:)And then you'd realize that
I'm a stallion that has to run free.

14
00:00:48,016 --> 00:00:50,516
(Leonard:)And that would turn you on a little.

15
00:00:51,019 --> 00:00:52,979
(Penny:)Okay, I'm an actress. Ask me again.

16
00:00:54,981 --> 00:00:58,151
(Leonard:)Do you mind if I spend the weekend
playing games with the guys?

